---
output: preproc, svg
---
@startuml
' A text line that starts with "!" is written with "!!": one "!" is removed.
' "!!{" stays the escape of an interpolation.
' EXPECT (preproc):
' Alice -> Bob : hello
' note over Alice
' !important
' !Warning: read this
' !
' !!triple
' !{x}
'   !indented
' end note
!x = 1
Alice -> Bob : hello
note over Alice
!!important
!!Warning: read this
!!
!!!triple
!!{x}
  !!indented
end note
@enduml
